@startuml US_3_2_6_Activation
title US 3.2.6 - Concluir ativação via link

actor User
participant Mail as "Email (activation link)"
participant SPA as "Browser"
participant Act as "ActivationController"
participant IAM as "IAM Provider (OIDC)"
database DB as "PortContext\n(ActivationToken, AppUser)"

Mail --> User: Activation link /activation/start?token=XYZ
User -> SPA: abre link
SPA -> Act: GET /activation/start?token=XYZ
Act -> Act: valida token hash + expiração
Act -> IAM: Challenge OIDC (PKCE)
IAM --> Act: code + tokens
Act -> DB: RedeemAsync(token, sub, email)\nset Active=true, store ExternalId
DB --> Act: ok ou null
alt sucesso
  Act --> User: Redirect https://localhost:4200/?activation=success
else mismatch/expirado
  Act --> User: página de erro (link inválido/expirado)
end

SPA -> API: GET /authtest/me
API --> SPA: user com roles
SPA -> API: GET /api/auth/role
API --> SPA: roles ativos ou 403

@enduml
